  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "Cook the farfalle pasta according to package directions until al dente.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Add the cooked farfalle pasta to the bowl and toss to coat with the lemon juice mixture.",
    "In a separate bowl, combine cherry tomatoes, kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, and feta cheese.",
    "Add the tomato mixture to the pasta and toss to combine.",
    "Transfer the pasta mixture to a ramekin and top with chopped fresh basil.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes or until the cheese is melted and bubbly."
